        // We cannot read owner directly here; but the distinguishing rule is that a call from THIS contract
        // (which is generally NOT the declared owner) should revert. We express the general rule as: if this
        // contract is not equal to c.owner(), then withdrawAll called from here must revert. Use the public getter.
        bool amOwner = (address(this) == c.owner());
